#: ../../infrastructure/compute/compute.rst:41
msgid ""
"The Virtual Machines tab lists all managed and unmanaged VMs across "
"|morpheus|. Managed VMs are either provisioned by |morpheus|, or are "
"inventoried/discovered VMs that have been converted to managed. Unmanaged "
"VMs are typically inventoried/discovered VMs from Cloud integrations."
msgstr ""
"El Máquinas virtuales pestaña lists todos administrado y unmanaged VMs a "
"través de |morpheus|. Administrado VMs son cualquiera aprovisionado por "
"|morpheus|, o son inventoried/discovered VMs ese tienen been converted a "
"administrado. Unmanaged VMs son típicamente inventoried/discovered VMs desde"
" Nube integrations."

#: ../../infrastructure/compute/compute.rst:43
msgid "**Virtual Machine Change Cloud**"
msgstr "**Máquina virtual Change Nube**"

#: ../../infrastructure/compute/compute.rst:45
msgid ""
"Change Cloud functionality allows a server to be reassociated to a new "
"Cloud, which may be necessary at times for easier record keeping in "
"|morpheus|. In order to use this feature, the user must have "
"\"Infrastructure: Move Servers\" permission set to \"Full.\""
msgstr ""
"Cambiar Nube functionality permite un servidor a be reassociated a un nuevo "
"Nube, cual puede be necessary en times para easier record keeping en "
"|morpheus|. Para usar este función, el usuario debe tienen "
"\"Infraestructura: Mover Servidores\" permiso establecer a \"Completo.\""

#: ../../infrastructure/compute/compute.rst:47
msgid ""
"Changing Clouds might be necessary, for example, when moving a VM from one "
"vCenter datacenter to another. We can use this tool to update the Cloud "
"association in |morpheus| as well. Other scenarios may include migrating "
"workloads from private Cloud to public Cloud or even creating a brand new VM"
" in a new Cloud which represents an identical workload to something pre-"
"existing but which will be retired."
msgstr ""
"Changing Nubes podría be necessary, por ejemplo, cuando moving un VM desde "
"one vCenter datacenter a another. We puede usar este tool a update el Nube "
"association en |morpheus| también. Otro scenarios puede incluir migrating "
"cargas de trabajo desde privado Nube a público Nube o incluso creating un "
"brand nuevo VM en un nuevo Nube cual represents un identical carga de "
"trabajo a something pre-existente pero cual será be retired."

#: ../../infrastructure/compute/compute.rst:49
msgid ""
"For VMware Clouds, Cloud reassignment occurs automatically when a server is "
"migrated from one cluster to another or from one resource pool to another "
"within the same cluster. Following the next Cloud sync, |morpheus| will "
"reflect the migration made in vCenter. In this scenario, you should not try "
"to use the manual change Cloud tools. In fact, you will receive a warning in"
" |morpheus| logs if you attempt to do so."
msgstr ""
"Para VMware Nubes, Nube reassignment occurs automáticamente cuando un "
"servidor es migrado desde one cluster a another o desde one recurso pool a "
"another dentro de el mismo cluster. Siguiente el siguiente Nube sync, "
"|morpheus| será reflect el migración made en vCenter. En este scenario, you "
"debería no try a usar el manual cambiar Nube tools. En fact, you será "
"recibir un warning en |morpheus| registros si you attempt a do así."

#: ../../infrastructure/compute/compute.rst:51
msgid ""
"To change Clouds, navigate to the VM detail page (|InfComVir| > selected "
"VM), click on the ACTIONS menu, and click Change Cloud. You can select the "
"new target Cloud here and optionally select a new VM which the current one "
"should be merged into. The important thing to keep in mind is that this tool"
" is for |morpheus| record keeping only. **It is not a tool which does "
"migration work for you.** See the embedded video below for a demonstration "
"of this feature."
msgstr ""
"A cambiar Nubes, navigate al VM página de detalles (|InfComVir| > "
"seleccionado VM), click en el ACTIONS menú, y click Cambiar Nube. You puede "
"seleccionar el nuevo destino Nube aquí y opcionalmente seleccionar un nuevo "
"VM cual el actual one debería be merged en. El importante thing a tenga en "
"cuenta es ese este tool es para |morpheus| record keeping solo. **It is not "
"a tool which does migración work for you.** Consulte la embedded video a "
"continuación para un demonstration de este función."

