#: ../../infrastructure/compute/compute.rst:81
msgid ""
"Resources represent objects that do not map to VM or Container types in "
"|morpheus|, such as IAC resources from Terraform, Cloudformation or ARM "
"Templates like VPC's, Gateways, Users, Policies, Brokers, API's, Endpoints, "
"Directories, ACL's, Routes... well anything really. All resources created "
"from IAC Templates map to iac provider resource types and |morpheus| "
"maintains a resource object record from the mapped resource."
msgstr ""
"Recursos represent objects ese do no mapear a VM o Contenedor tipos en "
"|morpheus|, como IAC recursos desde Terraform, Cloudformation o ARM "
"Templates like VPC's, Gateways, Usuarios, Policies, Brokers, API's, "
"Endpoints, Directories, ACL's, Routes... well anything really. Todos "
"recursos creado desde IAC Templates mapear a iac provider recurso tipos y "
"|morpheus| maintains un recurso object record desde el mapeado recurso."

#: ../../infrastructure/compute/compute.rst:83
msgid ""
